Summary:
Today’s session involved continuing the frontend development of the Multi-Vendor E-commerce Platform. The focus was on enhancing the existing UI by developing additional components and refining page layouts. Work was carried out on improving the structure of product listing and basic navigation between pages. The overall interface was made more organized and closer to the intended design.

Outcomes:
The frontend progressed with more structured and reusable components. Key pages became more functional with improved layout and navigation. This step strengthened the user interface and prepared it for integrating dynamic data from the backend in the next stages.
